  "effectiveDate": "2024-04-26",
  "historyNote": "#12774, eff 5-7-19; ss by #13172, eff 2-23-21 (see also Revision Note at part heading for He-C 801); ss by #13896, EXRF, eff 3-1-24; ss by #13949, EXRF, eff 4-26-24",
